Watchdeck
=========

Watchdeck is a fork-in-spirit of the YouTube Music Desktop App; its starting
point was the `pear-desktop` fork of that project:

  - https://github.com/th-ch/youtube-music
  - https://github.com/pear-devs/pear-desktop

Portions of this software (the Electron shell, the plugin framework, the config
store, and the build tooling around them) are derived from those projects, which
